    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EXCELLENT CITY CENTRE LOCATION / BRIGHT SPACIOUS CORNER APARTMENT / 3 BEDS 2 BATHS / LIVING ROOM BENEFITS FROM DUAL ASPECT FLOOR TO CEILING WINDOWS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW is thrilled to showcase this exceptional fourth floor three-bedroom corner apartment, ideally located just off Foley Street in the heart of the city.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 32 Liberty Corner. This generously sized apartment is bathed in natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere from the moment you step inside. A spacious hallway greets you upon entry, featuring a large storage closet equipped with partial shelving to maximize organization, an essential asset for any urban dweller.\r\n\r\nOff the hallway, you’ll find three generous double bedrooms, each with fitted wardrobes, including a large primary suite that boasts its own ensuite bathroom. The residence is further enhanced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom, fully tiled and featuring both a bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThe bright and airy open-plan living and dining area impresses with dual aspect floor-to-ceiling windows offering an abundance of light. This seamless flow leads into a bright fully fitted kitchen with floor and wall tiling and large picture window.\r\n\r\nSituated in a vibrant neighbourhood, this property is merely a stone's throw from the IFSC and Clarion Quay, renowned for their imaginative architectural designs and exceptional amenities. The convenience of this central location cannot be overstated, with every amenity imaginable just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\n32 Liberty Corner is perfectly positioned at the doorstep of the bustling city centre, providing easy access to all its offerings. The extensive public transport network nearby includes Connolly Station for DART and inter-city trains, Dublin Bus services, and a LUAS stop just seconds away, ensuring that you are well-connected. Additionally, you will be surrounded by a diverse array of essential and recreational amenities, making this property a truly enviable place to call home."
      },
